From: OpenCam build integration
Subject: Use the old MSVC secure-function fallback only with old MSVC

MinGW defines no _MSC_VER; treating it as zero incorrectly defines statement
macros over MinGW's existing wcscpy_s/wcscat_s declarations in stralign.h.
The pinned Intel source is MIT licensed; preserve this patch with its source.
--- a/libvpl/src/windows/mfx_dispatcher_defs.h
+++ b/libvpl/src/windows/mfx_dispatcher_defs.h
@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@
 #define MAX_PLUGIN_PATH 4096
 #define MAX_PLUGIN_NAME 4096
 
-#if _MSC_VER < 1400
+#if defined(_MSC_VER) && _MSC_VER < 1400
     #define wcscpy_s(to, to_size, from) \
         (void)(to_size);                \
         wcscpy(to, from)
